name: ['Armageddon', 'Burning of Xinye', 'Cataclysm', 'Child of Alara', 'Decree of Annihilation', 'Firespout', 'Fracturing Gust', 'Living Death', 'Martial Coup', 'Rolling Earthquake', 'Smokestack', 'Terminus', 'Upheaval', "Virtue's Ruin", 'Wrath of God']
